# THIS REPOSITORY IS PUBLIC (github.com/InnovoDeveloper/esphome-firmware,
# private: false). Anything committed here is world-readable forever, including in
# history after a later deletion.
#
# A 64-char factory key was previously recoverable with `strings` from an
# anonymously downloaded .ota.bin in this repo. Production images no longer contain
# any secret, but a FACTORY image does -- it has the factory key and the factory
# WiFi credentials compiled in. It must never land here.
#
# These patterns are a safety net, not the control. The real control is that factory
# builds use a different devicename (innovo-rbfg-fact) and therefore a different
# build directory from the one the publish step copies out of.
*factory*
*FACTORY*
*.local.env
factory-keys*
secrets.yaml
*.elf
*.map

# macOS metadata
.DS_Store
._*
